Fliki.ai – faceless video creator (text-to-video with stock footage and voiceovers).
Descript.com – edit video like docs (text-based video/audio editing with Overdub AI).
Gling.ai – YouTube video editor (AI that removes silences and filler words automatically).
Wisecut.video – auto-edit with AI (smart video editor that cuts, adds music, and captions).
Veed.io – online AI video suite (browser-based video editing with AI tools).
Clipchamp.com – quick video creation (Microsoft's easy video editor with AI features).
Lumen5.com – AI-powered social video (converts text into branded social media videos).
Steve.ai – cartoon explainer videos (creates animated explainer videos from text).
synthesys.io – convert blogs into videos (AI tool to turn written content into professional videos).
Descript.com – podcast editing (text-based editing for podcasts with AI overdub).
Zubtitle.com – captions for video (automatic captioning and subtitle tools).

